---
layout: base.njk
title: about
description: Experience and skills of George Danicico, a software engineer working with Java and Spring Boot.
---
<p>I'm a full stack engineer focused on Java and Spring Boot, and I enjoy frontend and DevOps work too.</p>

<h2>experience</h2>
{%- for job in resume.experience %}
<h3>{{ job.role }} @ {{ job.company }}</h3>
<p class="meta">{{ job.years }}</p>
<ul>
  {%- for point in job.highlights %}
  <li>{{ point }}</li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endfor %}

<h2>skills</h2>
<dl class="skills">
  {%- for group in resume.skills %}
  <div><dt>{{ group.area }}</dt><dd>{{ group.items | join(", ") }}</dd></div>
  {%- endfor %}
</dl>
